# Scratch diagnostics and integration handoff notes. An underscore prefix marks
# a throwaway: `tools/_diag-boot.mjs` answers one question during one
# investigation, unlike `tools/glsl-lint.mjs`, which is a real check the build
# depends on and is tracked. Same for `docs/_handoff-*.md`, which carry wiring
# notes between a parallel worker and the integrator and are obsolete once
# applied.
tools/_*
docs/_*
